        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 39:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I kare-nono abaka me Babulon, Merudak-baladan, wot a Baladaŋ owinyo ni abaka Kejekia rik kome lit; en te cwayo kwena me tero waraga baŋe karacel kede mot, pien onwoŋo owinyo ni doŋ otyeko caŋ oko i two mere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.39.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.39.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 39:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kejekia rik te jolo kwena mere naca i yomcuny, te nyuttigi lonyo mere, kun daŋ miogi oneno ot me kano limmere, gin oneno jabu, ryal, gigi mogo a ŋwecgi kur, moo me wel, ot me kano jami lwennyere luŋ, kede ginnoro luŋ ame onwoŋo tye i ot kano jami mere. Mom tye ginnoro ame en mom onyuto baŋgi ame onwoŋo tye i ode kede i lobo ame onwoŋo tye i te loccre. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.39.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.39.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 39:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cite odwarpiny Icaya rik te bino baŋ abaka Kejekia, te penye ni, “Jo-ni kara oya ikwene? Dok kop aŋo ame gin okobo?” Kejekia te gamo ni, “Gin oya i lobo abor meicel, oya i Babulon twal.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.39.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.39.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 39:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Icaya dok te penye ni, “Gin aŋo ame gin oneno i odi?” Kejekia te gamo ni, “Gin oneno jami ducu ame tye i oda; mom tye ginnoro ame tye i udi me kano lim ame mom anyuttigi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.39.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.39.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 39:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.39.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.39.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 39:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Icaya te kobbi abaka ni, “Koŋ doŋ iwiny kop a Rwot me mony okobo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.39.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.39.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 39:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nen ba, kare tye abino, ame jami ducu atye i odi, jami luŋ ame kwarowu yam obedo kano tuno kede naka tin, obino terogi luŋ i Babulon. Mom tye ginnoro ame bino doŋ kadi acel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.39.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.39.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 39:7"
          },
          "items": [
